Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,they rather pay uh for warm pool running CPUs so that whenever tasks come from the GPU, the CPUs are they're hot.\N他们宁愿为持续运行的热池CPU付费，这样当GPU有任务过来时，CPU就已经处于就绪状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're essentially working, right?\NCPU 实际上已经在工作了，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:14.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,So they'll we we I say we cuz we do mostly CPUs are certainly the cheap resource.\N所以我们会说，因为我们主要做 CPU，这显然是成本较低的资源。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know if we're cheap, but cheap resource for this.\N我不知道我们是不是便宜，但这个资源确实很便宜。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that spends more GPUs actually just because the cost of having an idle GPU is to is way more expensive, right?\N所以实际上会用更多GPU，因为让GPU闲置的成本要高得多，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's actually like a really interesting point, right?\N是的，这实际上是个非常有趣的观点，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:30.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The business model is like no one does I mean sure, there's on demand GPUs,\N这个商业模式——我是说，确实有按需 GPU，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:35.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,but like Lambda has like 50,000 plus GPUs and only 4,000 of them are on demand, right?\N但就像 Lambda 有超过 5 万块 GPU，其中只有 4000 块是按需可用的，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're always sold out.\N而且总是卖光。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,So like no one really has on demand GPUs.\N所以其实没人真的拥有按需 GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone's signing at minimum like long-term, you know, multi-month contracts, but in most cases multi-year contracts.\N大家都在签至少长期的合同，你知道的，几个月起步，大多数是多年期的合同。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:51.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and so like CPUs have been used to like you can spin them up and down, right?\N嗯，就像 CPU 可以随时启动和关闭一样，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.58,0:00:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why everyone moved to the cloud, right?\N这就是为什么大家都转向了云端，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:01:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um but with these RL workloads, it's like, okay, the GPU: the generator, the model running on a GPU generated a bunch of stuff.\N但这些强化学习工作负载的情况是，好吧，GPU作为生成器，运行在GPU上的模型生成了一大堆内容。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It sends it to the verifier.\N它将其发送给验证器。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:05.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the verifier is not ready and waiting Then it's idle.\N如果验证器没有提前准备好并等待，GPU 就会空闲。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:05.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then it's waiting.\N然后它在等待。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.\N对。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.15,0:01:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like the GPU is just sitting there.\N就像 GPU 就那样闲置着。
